    "pros": [
      "Brushless motor for quieter running and longer run time, per retailers",
      "100 lb at 36V or 80 lb at 24V, per ISO 13342 listings",
      "GPS anchor lock and heading hold",
      "Pairs wirelessly with Garmin chartplotters"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "About $3,600 to $4,500 at retailers",
      "Remote, pedal and transducer vary by bundle",
      "Thrust and shaft-length listings conflict between sellers"
